      "versionNonce": 5002,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Where we are now\nWebWeave is staged on Vercel (web-weave-lake.vercel.app) with Midtrans sandbox payments, auto-pricing-popup on quota exhaust, server-side payment status verification, and Supabase auth/data. Production-ready foundation built; public launch needs isolation, billing polishing, and policy work.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Where we are now\nWebWeave is usable as a local/private-beta QA generator with safety guardrails, real framework test evidence, Google OAuth, a polished v0-style sidebar/profile shell, Supabase projects/script history, and MCP-verified DB tables. It is not public SaaS-ready yet.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
