      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Next product milestone\nAdd projects/chats/templates pages, artifact storage, sandboxed run validation with one-shot AI repair, Google/Microsoft OAuth polish, landing page. Public SaaS waits for isolation hardening, billing polishing, and ToS/Privacy policy work.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Next product milestone\nMidtrans sandbox live test with ngrok, add usage/quota UI, real Projects/Chats/Templates pages, artifact storage, then sandboxed run validation with one-shot AI repair. Public SaaS still waits for isolation, billing polishing, and policy work.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
