      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "V11 - LemonSqueezy Billing Scaffold\nPlaceholder-safe billing (not live):\n- Store, product, variant env mapping\n- Server-created checkout (POST /api/billing/checkout)\n- Signed webhook receiver (POST /api/billing/webhook)\n- Supabase billing metadata columns\n- Monthly generation quota enforcement\n- Pricing CTA wired to real checkout\n- Env-safe: no crash when config missing\n- LemonSqueezy setup tutorial in README\nStatus: code kept, not default gateway",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "V11 - LemonSqueezy Billing Scaffold\nPlaceholder-safe billing (not live):\n- Store, product, variant env mapping\n- Server-created checkout (POST /api/billing/checkout)\n- Signed webhook receiver (POST /api/billing/webhook)\n- Supabase billing metadata columns\n- Monthly generation quota enforcement\n- Pricing CTA wired to real checkout\n- Env-safe: no crash when config missing\n- LemonSqueezy setup tutorial in README\nStatus: code kept, not default gateway",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
