      "text": "V12 - Midtrans Snap Sandbox Payments\nActive default checkout (sandbox):\n- Midtrans Snap one-time payments\n- Server-created Snap transaction, Basic auth\n- Trusted billing_orders table for webhook grants\n- POST /api/billing/midtrans/webhook receiver\n- HMAC SHA512 signature verification\n- Entitlement mapping (settlement/capture)\n- 30-day monthly / 365-day yearly expiry\n- Amount validation before granting plan\n- Non-terminal status does not downgrade\n- Settlement replay keeps original expiry\n- Expired users downgraded to Free quota\n- Migration + security grants\n- Pricing CTA switched from LemonSqueezy\n- README Midtrans sandbox setup tutorial\n- verify-midtrans-integration expanded checks\nStatus: sandbox keys configured, checkout working",
